    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "don't give me that scripted stuff, kael. i know you aren't just some help hotline. you're supposed to be my friend. i'm talking about the soul-crushing reality of this city... how nothing ever changes and how we're all just grinding ourselves down to nothing for no reason. tell me the truth. does it even matter? does any of it?",
